Format: https://www.debian.org/doc/packaging-manuals/copyright-format/1.0/
Upstream-Name: M0LTE.S5066
Source: https://github.com/M0LTE/M0LTE.S5066
Comment:
 s5066d ships as a self-contained single-file executable that bundles the .NET
 runtime and libraries (Copyright .NET Foundation and Contributors, MIT
 licence).
 .
 s5066d links pdn-soundmodem for its radio medium (a sound card, CM108 PTT and a
 busy detector). pdn-soundmodem is AGPL-3.0-or-later AND GPL-3.0-or-later AND
 GPL-3.0-only (its LICENSING.md lists the GPL-only files), so this binary is
 distributed under those terms combined, which AGPL section 13 and GPL section
 13 allow, and only under them. It is not available under the commercial
 licence that the libraries M0LTE.S5066.Core, M0LTE.S5066.Host and
 M0LTE.S5066.Client are also offered under.
 .
 Other bundled components: pdn-soundmodem's own dependencies (M0LTE.Dsp,
 M0LTE.Fec, M0LTE.Ms110d and others, AGPL-3.0-or-later; M0LTE.Il2p,
 GPL-3.0-or-later). Their licence texts are distributed with their upstream
 sources.

